family Air Handling Unit
category equipment
host floor
ifc IfcUnitaryEquipment AIRHANDLER
param Length length type 2000mm
param Width length type 1000mm
param Height length type 1400mm
param PortD length type 400mm
param Source number type 1
param Casing material type "Steel White"
type "2000x1000" Length=2000mm
type "3000x1400" Length=3000mm, Width=1400mm, Height=1800mm, PortD=630mm
type "118x55 in" Length=3000mm, Width=1400mm, Height=1800mm, PortD=630mm
type "900x600" Length=900mm, Width=600mm, Height=500mm, PortD=160mm
extrude Body rect(-Length / 2, -Width / 2, Length / 2, Width / 2) z(0mm, Height) mat(Casing) show(3d, elev)
symbol rect(-Length / 2, -Width / 2, Length / 2, Width / 2)
symbol line(-Length / 2, -Width / 2, Length / 2, Width / 2) show(medium, fine)
connector Supply duct supply_air at(Length / 4, 0, Height) dir(0, 0, 1) size(PortD)
connector Return duct return_air at(-Length / 4, 0, Height) dir(0, 0, 1) size(PortD)
